Object.assign(DIALOG_CLIPS.clips,{"tom|Every clock in town. Sal says zero o’clock.":"","amy|Justin is at the shop, rewiring the whole block by flashlight. He says go. He says bring snacks.":"","sal|Cab seven! Everybody in. Long Island Regional. The door nobody uses.":"","la_woman|DING. Passengers are reminded that the gate clock is missing its hands. Passengers will kindly find them.":"","la_woman|DING. Good evening, and welcome to Terminal Zero. Flight Zero to Nowhere is now boarding at Gate Zero. Boarding Group Zero only.":"","amy|Directory. Security top left. Baggage Claim top right. The Lounge bottom left. Gate Zero, up the middle.":"","rose|I was SMELLING it.":"","tom|Stay close, everybody. Shoes on. Liquids in a bag.":"","log|Please wait to be called. PLEASE. WAIT. TO BE CALLED.":"","tom|Every board says midnight. Every gate says zero. And somebody dusted the plants.":"","tom|Shoes off, everyone. Not you, Rose. Rose, put your shoe back on.":"","amy|Up! Everybody up! Walk it off. Hydrate. We have a flight to catch. Probably.":"","tom|A long brass clock hand. Stamped on the back: GATE 0, HOUR. It goes on the gate clock.":"","log|You win. Here. The hour hand. Go on through.":"","mudling|Round and round. Round and round. Every other bag got picked up. Every one. Since 1989.":"","mudling|I have the minute hand. It goes round and round too. We understand each other.":"","mudling|...You stopped the carousel. For me.":"","grace|They go in the order we found them! Like a clock. Going round. I KNEW the list was important.":"","mudling|Claimed. Oh. Here. The minute hand. Take it to the gate.":"","tom|A long brass clock hand. Stamped on the back: GATE 0, MINUTE. It goes on the gate clock.":"","grump|Occupied. All of them. Both armrests. The middle seat. The window. Mine.":"","amy|Tom has very strong opinions about armrests.":"","tom|Everybody should have very strong opinions about armrests.":"","tom|Thank you. That was very big of you.":"","grump|...Fine. You can sit. Here. The second hand. And you can have an armrest. One. The left one.":"","amy|Tom. The cabinet. Pajamas. With a little gold zero on the pocket.":"","tom|A long brass clock hand. Stamped on the back: GATE 0, SECOND. It goes on the gate clock.":"","amy|Sending it to Justin.":"","amy|\"Best one yet. Is that an airport? At midnight?? Proud of you guys.\" With the heart. He used the heart.":"","tom|Somebody with a little clock. And one more coin.":"","grace|The sundial, the steamer, the sign-up sheet, the jar, the book, the oven, the Mirrorball. I knew it. I KNEW the list was important.":"","bigone|DING. Passengers! Oh. Oh, PASSENGERS. At Gate Zero. This is the LAST CALL for Flight Zero.":"","bigone|Flight Zero was due out at midnight. 1989. I called it and called it. Nobody came to the gate. Nobody answered.":"","tom|So you stopped every clock on Long Island at midnight.":"","bigone|And somebody DID. Group Zero. Now boarding. All of you. Forever.":"","amy|Up, everybody. Walk it off.":"","amy|Tom, when she calls one of us, that person has to move before she goes again. Or you stand in front of them. And nobody has answered her since 1989. Three times.":"","tom|Girls, Amy, behind me. Watch the board. When she calls your name, you move. No touching, please.":"","rose|A PLANE. A real one. Out the window. Its lights are on. Tata, its lights are ON.":"","tom|A gold coin. Same little clock face. Number eight.":"","amy|My watch. Tom. My WATCH. It says twelve oh one. Twelve oh one!":"","grace|Every clock in the whole town is going again. I can FEEL it.":"","tom|The sundial. The steamer. The sign-up sheet. My jar. The book from 1952. The oven from 1963. The Mirrorball from 1971. And a gate from 1989.":"","amy|Hey. Nobody cancelled you. You just needed a crowd. Look. You have a crowd.":"","tom|Somebody who knows I always make my connection.":"","amy|Tom. Who IS that?":"","tom|He left a card on the podium. Gold ink. \"THANK YOU FOR FLYING NOWHERE. YOUR LAYOVER WILL BE ANNOUNCED.\" And a little clock.":"","tom|My boarding pass changed. \"BOARDING GROUP 0. FROM: LONG ISLAND. TO: NOWHERE. STATUS: LAYOVER.\"":"","boppy|My stomach is still on midnight. My stomach is always on midnight.":"","grace|DAD!":"","justin|Hey, everybody. The lights all came back on at twelve oh one. So I came back too. I brought bread.":"","amy|Mostly Amy. Put that on a shirt.":"","tom|A text from TNB. \"babe. every clock in LA stopped at midnight. they just started again. was that you?\"":"","tom|Everybody comes next time.":"","tom|Tom writes back: \"Mostly Amy.\" TNB sends a heart. Tom sends one back. Then another one.":"","tom|To the moon and back, everybody. Eat. Deedee made everything.":"","toad|Wheels up! Round two!":"","toad|Round 2. Still fits. Probably.":"","toad|Round 3. Still fits. Probably.":"","toad|Round 4. Still fits. Probably.":"","toad|Round 5. Still fits. Probably.":"","toad|...it fits. It FITS. Push harder.":"","skeeter|I flew in from somewhere. I forget where. It was later there.":"","skeeter|Yawn. Round two.":"","skeeter|Round 3. Still not sure what time it is.":"","skeeter|Round 4. Still not sure what time it is.":"","skeeter|...what time is it. What DAY is it.":"","skeeter|Five more minutes. Five more hours.":"","skeeter|Round 2. Still not sure what time it is.":"","log|Back of the line! Round two!":"","log|Round 2. Still waiting.":"","log|Round 4. Still waiting.":"","log|...please wait. Please wait. Please wait.":"","log|Next. No. Not you. Wait.":"","log|Round 5. Still waiting.":"","mudling|Round 2. Round and round.":"","mudling|Round 3. Round and round.":"","mudling|Round and round! Round two!":"","mudling|Round 4. Round and round.":"","mudling|Round 5. Round and round.":"","mudling|...round and round. Round and round.":"","mudling|Somebody will come. Somebody always comes.":"","grump|Sharing is for people with window seats.":"","grump|Round 2. Still mine.":"","grump|Round 3. Still mine.":"","grump|Round 4. Still mine.":"","grump|Round 5. Still mine.":"","grump|...mine. Both of them. Mine.":"","bigone|Flight Zero was due out at midnight. 1989. Nobody came to the gate.":"","bigone|Round 2. Still boarding.":"","bigone|DING. Round two. Please have your pass ready.":"","bigone|Round 3. Still boarding.":"","grump|Hey! I was sitting there! Round two!":"","bigone|Round 5. Still boarding.":"","bigone|Round 4. Still boarding.":"","bigone|...Flight Zero. Now boarding. Now boarding.":"","sal|Terminal Zero, though. Terminal Zero is open.":"","amy|Seven coins. Seven chapters of your life, Tom. Somebody has been planning this.":"","amy|Every clock in our house stopped at twelve. The microwave. The oven. My running watch. My RUNNING WATCH, Tom.":"","deedee|To the moon and BACK.":"","skeeter|Round 5. Still not sure what time it is.":"","grace|It has SO many stickers. Tata, look. Paris. Tokyo. Cleveland.":"","log|Round 3. Still waiting.":""});
